              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The Horned Raiment provides Magnus the Red with a 2+ Armour Save and a 4+ Invulnerable Save. In addition , if he is struck by a weapon with the Destroyer type, the amount of Wounds it inflicts is reduced by 1, to a minimum of 1</characteristic>
